e=\"width: 10.2364%;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 18.4796%;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Final Impression:</strong></span></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong>Conclusion</strong></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">IHC findings are consistent with a metastatic carcinoma showing positivity for [e.g., CK7 and TTF-1], suggesting a likely <strong>pulmonary primary</strong>. Clinical and radiological correlation is strongly recommended.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
